<title>SINGAPORE: Hour Glass interim profit down 49.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Hour Glass interim profit down 49.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  2.54   vs	5.05</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)    2.35   vs	5.63</p>
<p>    Turnover		  172.26   vs    221.12</p>
<p>    Interest income	   0.42   vs	0.63</p>
<p>    Associates		  0.04   vs     (0.09)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     4.61   vs	8.75</p>
<p>    Tax			   2.61   vs	2.94</p>
<p>    Minorities		  0.51   vs	0.66</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is The Hour Glass Ltd. The company is in the business of wholesaling and retailing of watches, jewellery and related products.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
